<h1>Pick Pair of Planes</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is accessible from</span> <span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Measure &gt; Pick Pairs of Planes</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
<p class="description"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">: The function Pick Pair of Planes is used to</span> measure the on-screen distances and angle between planes.</p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Select Plane 1 by left-clicking the mouse anywhere on the desired plane. Information about Plane1 (normal and offset) will appear in the information box on left. Then select Plane 2. Information about Plane 2 (normal and offset) will also appear in the information box on left. The difference between Plane 1 and Plane 2 centres and angle between the planes will be immediately calculated and displayed in the tab on left.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../Working_with_data/Measuring_files/image12.gif" width="71px" height="29px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""> &#160;&#160;&#160;Mouse pointers in</span> <span class="Mode" style="font-weight:bold; text-decoration:none;"><b>Pick Pairs Of Planes</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">mode</span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB">Absolute and Screen Difference:</span></p>
<p><img src="../Working_with_data/Measuring_files/image14.gif" width="574px" height="440px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></p>
<ul class="whs6">
<li style="text-align:justify;" class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Absolute Difference distance between</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Plane centre 1</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">and</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Plane centre 2</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
</li>
<li style="text-align:justify;" class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Plane 1 with</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>X</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">,</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Y</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">, and</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Z</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">co-ordinates of</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Plane centre 1</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">(not shown in the information box).</span></p>
</li>
<li style="text-align:justify;" class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Plane 2 with</span><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>X</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">,</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Y</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">, and</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Z</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">co-ordinates of</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Plane centre 2</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">(not shown in the information box).</span></p>
</li>
<li style="text-align:justify;" class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Difference distance between</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Point 1</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">and</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Point 2</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">in terms of the</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>X</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">,</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Y</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">and</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Z</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">planes.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB">Angle between planes:</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../Measure/images/pick_pair_of_planes_angle.gif" width="191px" height="115px" border="0" class="img_whs7" alt=""></span></p>
<ul class="whs6">
<li style="text-align:justify;" class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Plane 1 normal and Plane2 normal define a virtual plane (not drawn in the viewport).</span></p>
</li>
<li style="text-align:justify;" class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">The angle between plane normals on this plane in their positive direction is set as angle between planes and respectively shown in the result information box.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">The information about plane centre difference and angle between planes are also copied in</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Output</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">pane.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP290065637" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<table cellspacing="0" class="whs8">
<col>
<tr valign="top" class="whs9">
<td class="whs10">
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;"><img src="../Measure/images/pick_pair_of_planes.gif" width="763px" height="535px" border="0" class="img_whs11" alt=""></p>
<ul class="whs6">
<li style="text-align:justify; margin-left:-20px;" class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Orthogonal distance between Plane 1 centre and Plane 2, and angle between planes.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p>&#160;</p>
</div>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Exit</span> <span class="Mode" style="font-weight:bold; text-decoration:none;"><b>Pick Pairs Of Points</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">mode by clicking on the Close button in the bottom of the tab.</span></p>
